previous.quote:
Given that previous studies (e.g.
Tzeng, 1973
;
Bjork & Whitten, 1974
) found mixed results, we reexamined the negative-recency effect in final-free recall following both CDFR lists and DFR lists in which there was no inter-item distractor.

